WEBVTT

00:37:59.203 --> 00:38:01.264
Well, I think this is one of the ways

00:38:01.288 --> 00:38:04.264
that emotional intelligence
gets weaponized.

00:38:04.288 --> 00:38:07.978
There are a lot of people
who associate care and empathy

00:38:08.002 --> 00:38:09.340
with emotional intelligence,

00:38:09.364 --> 00:38:13.237
but by definition, emotional intelligence
is a set of abilities,

00:38:13.261 --> 00:38:15.761
not a set of motivations or values.

00:38:15.785 --> 00:38:18.583
And that means that how emotionally
intelligent you are,

00:38:18.607 --> 00:38:21.336
how good you are at recognizing and using

00:38:21.360 --> 00:38:24.106
and managing emotions
in yourself and others,

00:38:24.130 --> 00:38:25.750
that's completely independent

00:38:25.774 --> 00:38:28.941
of whether you are more
of a giver or a taker.

00:38:28.965 --> 00:38:30.776
And sure enough there is some research